The marks in this folder come from two sources, both released under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Dot draws every one in one colour, the theme's ink, through the
file's shape alone (a CSS mask, item 946), so that a file's own colours never show.

Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), version 16.36.0: each file as the source draws it, the brand's symbol as one
path: 1password.svg, airtable.svg, alibabacloud.svg, astro-icon.svg, atlassian.svg, betterstack.svg, braintrust.svg,
